### Get all aircraft
GET http://localhost:8080/aircraft

### Create aircraft
POST http://localhost:8080/aircraft
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "manufacturer": "Boeing",
  "model": "F/A-18E Super Hornet",
  "type": "Fighter Aircraft",
  "maxSpeed": 1190,
  "range": 1275,
  "crew": 1,
  "firstFlight": "1995-11-29",
  "status": "Active"
}

### Get all missions
GET http://localhost:8080/missions

### Create mission
POST http://localhost:8080/missions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Artemis II",
  "agency": "NASA",
  "vehicle": "Orion",
  "destination": "Moon",
  "launchDate": "2026",
  "status": "Planned",
  "crewSize": 4
}

